COPY public.adaptive_questions (id, learner_id, project_id, question_text, option_a, option_b, option_c, option_d, correct_answer, explanation, difficulty, created_at) FROM stdin;
83ac2cb7-11a2-43fd-a4b0-b5a0c7a8118a	a086f191-22a8-4b0d-8ffd-44f419e52edb	791553e4-9051-47cc-84c5-ef11694ee801	What is the primary characteristic of a unicorn startup?	A) A startup valued at over $1 billion.	B) A startup with over 1,000 employees.	C) A startup that has gone public.	D) A startup operating in multiple countries.	A	A unicorn startup is defined as a privately owned company valued at over $1 billion.	easier	2026-06-01 09:00:17.38926+00
6ad79b15-9395-4b1c-b94f-f7e5ad0b9a04	a086f191-22a8-4b0d-8ffd-44f419e52edb	791553e4-9051-47cc-84c5-ef11694ee801	Which European toll system uses GPS tracking devices in the cab to calculate distance traveled?	A) France's Toll Booth System	B) Germany's GNSS Toll System	C) Switzerland's LSVA System	D) Austria's Vignette System	B	Germany's GNSS Toll System uses GPS tracking devices (on-board units) to calculate toll costs based on distance traveled.	easier	2026-06-01 09:00:17.389564+00
263bdf3a-ba6b-4a62-b4a0-d50e695e2325	a086f191-22a8-4b0d-8ffd-44f419e52edb	791553e4-9051-47cc-84c5-ef11694ee801	Which of the following is a key factor in scaling a unicorn startup?	A) Cloud infrastructure	B) Local marketing campaigns	C) Reducing employee count	D) Avoiding global expansion	A	Cloud infrastructure is a critical factor in scaling a unicorn startup as it enables efficient growth and global operation.	easier	2026-06-01 09:00:17.389631+00
f2453698-235e-4585-a981-c9e0755679bd	a086f191-22a8-4b0d-8ffd-44f419e52edb	7ba430b5-849e-48e7-aba9-902af6db4577	What defines a startup as a unicorn?	A) A startup with over 1,000 employees	B) A startup valued at over $1 billion	C) A startup that has gone public	D) A startup with global operations	B	A unicorn is a privately owned startup valued at over $1 billion.	easier	2026-06-01 11:09:57.958209+00
b66b1b7f-e43d-42bb-accf-fe35e2dc2757	a086f191-22a8-4b0d-8ffd-44f419e52edb	7ba430b5-849e-48e7-aba9-902af6db4577	Which concept is essential for startups to validate ideas quickly?	A) Series A funding	B) Minimum Viable Product (MVP)	C) Global expansion	D) Hiring engineering teams	B	The Minimum Viable Product (MVP) allows startups to test and validate ideas quickly with minimal resources.	easier	2026-06-01 11:09:57.958405+00
cce5f4a4-a347-4ae9-aa1f-5dccd86fb978	a086f191-22a8-4b0d-8ffd-44f419e52edb	7ba430b5-849e-48e7-aba9-902af6db4577	What is a key strategy for scaling a unicorn startup globally?	A) Bootstrapping	B) Cloud infrastructure and automation	C) Local marketing campaigns	D) Equity dilution	B	Cloud infrastructure and automation are essential for scaling operations efficiently and supporting global expansion.	easier	2026-06-01 11:09:57.958545+00
