c71c9db1-ed9a-4875-9b77-a89ae7db53b9	20c2d628-a458-406a-97aa-1f71e52127c7	791553e4-9051-47cc-84c5-ef11694ee801	0	Unicorns Learning Path (Startup Unicorns)\n1. What Is a Unicorn?\n\nA unicorn is a privately owned startup valued at over $1 billion.\n\nLearn:\n\nDifference between startup vs enterprise\nValuation basics\nWhy unicorns matter in tech/business\n\nExamples:\n\nOpenAI\nStripe\nSpaceX\n2. Startup Fundamentals\n\nTopics:\n\nMVP (Minimum Viable Product)\nProduct-market fit\nLean startup methodology\nGrowth hacking\n\nFocus:\n\nHow startups validate ideas fast\nWhy most startups fail\n3. Funding Stages\n\nLearn the startup funding lifecycle:\n\nBootstrapping\nAngel investors\nSeed round\nSeries A/B/C\nIPO or acquisition\n\nKey concepts:\n\nVenture Capital (VC)\nEquity dilution\nBurn rate\nRunway\n4. How Unicorns Scale\n\nTopics:\n\nCloud infrastructure\nHiring engineering teams\nDevOps & automation\nAI/data-driven growth\nGlobal expansion\n\nTech stack examples:\n\nAzure\nKubernetes\nMicroservices\nTerraform\nCI/CD\n5. Business Models\n\nStudy:\n\nSaaS\nMarketplace\nSubscription\nFinTech\nAI platforms\n\nQuestions to ask:\n\nHow does the company make money?\nWhat is the moat?\nWhat makes scaling possible?\n6. Analyze Real Unicorns\n\nPick 3-5 companies and study:\n\nFounding story\nFunding rounds\nArchitecture\nMonetization\nFailures and pivots\n\nGood case studies:\n\nAirbnb\nDatabricks\nRevolut\nNotion\n7. Build Your Own Mini Unicorn Project\n\nCreate:\n\nSaaS app\nAI assistant\nWorkflow automation platform\nInternal enterprise tool\n\nRecommended stack:\n\nPython + FastAPI\nReact/Next.js\nPostgreSQL\nDocker\nAzure\n8. Advanced Topics\n\nAfter basics:\n\nPlatform engineering\nAI agents\nDistributed systems\nFinOps\nSecurity & compliance\nMulti-tenant SaaS architecture\nSuggested Timeline\nWeek 1: Startup basics + funding\nWeek 2: Product-market fit + scaling\nWeek 3: Study real unicorns\nWeek 4: Build your own MVP	423	[-0.024536133,0.024276733,-0.027297974,-0