37d1c6c5-8e8e-4e5a-b5bc-1711e72371e4	389ac876-e11d-4d4d-8914-58f9295fd59c	Which of the following is a contraindication for taking Paracetamol 500mg tablets?	A) Severe liver disease	B) Mild headache	C) Period pain	D) Muscle aches	A	Paracetamol 500mg tablets should not be taken by individuals with severe liver disease as stated in the contraindications section of the leaflet.	f	aee8df2a-a4c9-41aa-ad96-c9ddb60602f0	25bfe6a5-74f5-4732-8e0d-e031ebf5b99a
