6d5bb33f-e82c-4230-b772-ebf2faa887b3	389ac876-e11d-4d4d-8914-58f9295fd59c	What is the recommended course of action if a paracetamol overdose is suspected?	A) Wait for symptoms to appear before seeking medical attention	B) Seek emergency medical attention immediately	C) Consume food to reduce the effects of overdose	D) Take another dose to counteract the overdose	B	Paracetamol overdose is dangerous and may lead to liver damage. Seeking emergency medical attention immediately is crucial, as the antidote N-acetylcysteine (NAC) is most effective within 8-10 hours of ingestion.	f	e1c1581b-4ef1-4d6d-8939-c62402367cee	896d0dc9-2bb8-4e06-a2c2-4f8804d8f788
